Add hasSofaBedHint compound flag that triggers on 'sofa bed', 'sleeper',
'pull-out', etc. When active, suppresses generic bed/sofa penalties and
applies a 0.5 penalty to any non-Sofa-Bed subcategory, plus +2 bonus for
exact Sofa Bed subcategory match.

Previously 'medium sectional sofa bed' was matching Small U-shaped
sectional (168.1 ft3) instead of Medium sectional sofa bed (184.3 ft3)
due to shared 'sectional'/'sofa' keywords with no subcategory guard.

